{"root":"busa","ipa":"/ˈbusa/","core":"泡沫，肥皂沫，唾沫","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈbusa/","zh":"泡沫，指液体表面形成的细小气泡集合，或因洗涤剂产生的泡沫，也指口中溢出的白沫。","phrases":[{"t":"busa sabun","zh":"肥皂沫"},{"t":"busa laut","zh":"海浪泡沫"},{"t":"berbusa-busa","zh":"泡沫翻涌的，喋喋不休的"}],"examples":[{"t":"Sabun ini menghasilkan banyak busa.","zh":"这种肥皂能产生很多泡沫。"},{"t":"Mulutnya berbusa karena kelelahan.","zh":"他因为过度劳累而口吐白沫。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"busa","ipa":"/ˈbusa/","zh":"泡沫","phrase":{"t":"busa mandi","zh":"沐浴泡沫"},"example":{"t":"Busa itu menutupi permukaan air.","zh":"泡沫覆盖了水面。"}},{"w":"berbusa","ipa":"/bərˈbusa/","zh":"起泡沫的，有泡沫的","phrase":{"t":"minuman berbusa","zh":"起泡饮料"},"example":{"t":"Air terjun itu tampak berbusa di bawah.","zh":"瀑布下方看起来泡沫翻涌。"}},{"w":"membusa","ipa":"/məmˈbusa/","zh":"起泡沫，产生泡沫","phrase":{"t":"membusa di mulut","zh":"口吐白沫"},"example":{"t":"Air sabun mulai membusa saat dikocok.","zh":"肥皂水摇晃时开始产生泡沫。"}},{"w":"berbusa-busa","ipa":"/bərˌbusaˈbusa/","zh":"泡沫四溢的，形容说话非常激动或喋喋不休","phrase":{"t":"berbusa-busa menjelaskan","zh":"滔滔不绝地解释"},"example":{"t":"Dia berbusa-busa menceritakan pengalamannya.","zh":"他激动得唾沫横飞地讲述着他的经历。"}}],"derSlugs":["busa","berbusa","membusa","berbusa-busa"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-10-01T02:18:15.382Z","src":"base"}